      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6c2377fb247ba63945cd4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢之情成功传达了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bbdf36fbbc6002cfe2f49cd95d40d983c5b40092cf5974bf94e9b9194762cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f13134625bb4058324a2adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们来传达感谢之情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b98c5b75f51060b4cf5596765c88cf386b29165a51ada28fff33b3e53872af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea987f61b52ef24e7e9c137",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一切都是从那一天开始的。\n呵呵，你的”护送“，\n非常棒哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6c373f83e5b49146750630a7c5baf35aba1b9b1adc1cd4b56eaf040941be07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b11af83d7b8ae608a50202e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又很可爱，又便于行动～！\n日本的水手服真是很棒的文化呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "27128c63fb156129644e999f91396b4a2b34d9a2d47a8930f2d07b17e46e81f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77635d96bc5e6fce0e7e35ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然露出肚脐…！\n女仆小姐们看了会吓一大跳吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bc7e325ca35a6c67fef4bf8f6f04532fa6a7f0f4776bdf6a0641421d2d7439e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8407996766278cda2cbac381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸前的徽章很漂亮吧？\n这可是我最中意的一点呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e434a2ece5b191fcb911a850217432e3cc99a152df75391685566f00d4dc60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646b56dcc8820c4d101c2153",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不少学生都穿着有袖的款式，\n真是传统的制服呀…我的父母也很佩服哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1448de06d8d4b2809e1b5aa913a56f3739fd12d01a600dfb06691b6077e77cb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4838970b685ca71db77ea8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑起来的话，褶边也跟着翩翩起舞…真漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ee4d5d22f64d62ffbf095403b4ea4c3d4fef2780428fba80bf816987a85a8b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f7fa211a6838ec8c9c449e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚绿翡翠…包含了不少祖国的回忆呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54c9a89107c6355cc61e4cfb77ba8a1b4c6775c1d158e5cff8673e360a571997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc1314c84ce08c73498a57e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这莫非就是所谓的，First look？\r\n（西方结婚时新郎在结婚当天才能看见新年穿婚纱的模样）",
      "source_fingerprint": "03070f428435cea71fe87fb951bc8790f4241370ad257160df80aff352cbf73e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89e007334b454e2f9aa3a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实呢……\r\n这身衣服里面有蹄铁的刺绣哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09745c6e7a0874174f23f444171778051c6dd8ad5404db3a6d9721432a11d68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d529423e5a99f97fca2b9f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵～☆怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7034237b6641cbe859dd9e1454f380fbd496c246d884b9b3448d7ed650babd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc5e35efdfd41f0b82ddeb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也早已做好不会败北的觉悟了…\n那么，跑起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a93d6ef1988c6053bd19aac1c2ccc864cfeab4110c33ea7e45680cd753b154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a07f703794c55455cf410f8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、お出かけ？\r\n今日はどこに行こうか♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f691a35cde0936b9642f30b43c41ad3086110ff48c6d619f05be9da4a3d5e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90048ecb1cbe04dbdeedb8ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "足元には願掛けの意味もあるの。\r\n1日中、晴れていますように…って！",
      "source_fingerprint": "070c6723940eb15be9eb0fcbc1f3dfddc8e1c98a767f2dffc098b4957aaa7e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbd715b0429b1663e8cea8f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又很可爱，又便于行动～！\n日本的水手服真是很棒的文化呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "27128c63fb156129644e999f91396b4a2b34d9a2d47a8930f2d07b17e46e81f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
