      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d53ae179df92c32007d7b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也早已做好不会败北的觉悟了…\n那么，跑起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a93d6ef1988c6053bd19aac1c2ccc864cfeab4110c33ea7e45680cd753b154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24dccd980330ad5fec91b534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a505d85108a7f591752067",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这将会成为一场足以铭刻于\r\n记忆之中的美妙对决呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "063ebb023af5f265f3dc0118396c3c13e73543e2aef75c1ac97730ccaa9aa2ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05c67f3226848147559644a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这才是火热青春的感觉♪\r\n还远不能放弃哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca20aaff9e6efb27068e49a7f65c71f8568fb697be705576b6377ea62ab4bbc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:186983206a359e8880a708ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贵安！\n为了留下珍贵回忆，\n今天也要度过美好的一天哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "57cd7fd58f8cbe9014d66e303e16f8f850a2f6bdc68e8f34f091d9e53ff49b14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9885d1a8034f34e3e18f3f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经习惯起床后没有女仆贴身服务了……\n哼哼，今天我也打扮得很漂亮吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5878061c365ac6c1e0c03576fee73e9343fc8e82fb9bdb1e0fa0708a6cf4189c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9734d90cc21f0e68df5863cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂的土豆炖肉很美味哦！\n因为祖国没什么人吃土豆，\n所以我一下子就迷上了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a951b6d0392bf9f32ed1eb7a1864b8d297ef9a5b54eb1962283c24dd59e7f285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537f5de915634488705cf33b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午后准备做一些比较轻松的运动哦～\n…对了！\n能陪我练下足球的传球吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c134453ac602a11682c5b0b5236f5aa95d5d222843aeeedf37a9d8e17a9bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592f8f0927479cec45371588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦你啦～♪\n你今天也过得很开心吧？\n希望明天也是美好的一天呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fa8984e2af6fd5ef79606ad0caac9774b9255bf15b7963db4939f26cf1adfe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567ca82f74e051fbd9398d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在考虑睡觉前要不要喝脱咖啡因红茶呢…\n你要一起来喝吗？\n还能一起玩红茶占卜呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c277a3c5038d6642443fa98178a5573d67d12a430163f9e563b9beaa24e06cf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ac23a2ed0a596b1b530cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前在公园里，\n看见了好多白色三叶草呢。\n好像能用花冠来进行加冕典礼的样子♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d49cb6a25e0adc5facbfb10b76b0afeb932f69324469019cb605a5840c70ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2052dafacdca1868b365f695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～每天都很热呢～。\n虽然也去不少国家视察过了…\n但这个湿度果然只有日本了呢！有这种感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58220747042d604c85758342075a273fce27dd857d591dc23626f524ab98c774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e9022af65be37f6c03db6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本的三叶草，\n是不是在秋天就会减少呀…？呒呒…！\n因为变得珍贵了，说不定找到之后就更幸福了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad93b2a370c617ab87b3e7a4d7080a9eada9722b4f54ebca43122b37d4b71fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3eae3def305de06321e47e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在很冷的时候，\n就会很喜欢喝女仆小姐做得超甜的奶茶呢…\n我会用马克杯喝很多呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d24fd6f559cca8eaa9a492d6ed982cfa7eecfc29d9e7c3e8eb0d044561bec3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b11c54e3b5ec306153b08a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是美妙的晨间问答时间♪\r\n问：我的左边鞋子里，\r\n正放着什么东西呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4730bfb490db88888d953e3cdbc57e21aefb908e8d9a1424ae3542280a2ceb3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7270c8b7c37b11a176111cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天做了个特别有趣的梦哦！\r\n我梦见在婚礼上，学园的大家都来为我进行暖戒礼呢！\r\n（暖戒礼：西式婚礼上将婚戒传给所有人以表祝福）",
      "source_fingerprint": "358f181cb09efcf08ff7a7d5b23b8cbbd06217ead56104c18a5098d9e2298c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37d0647a6de77e7ce256dd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天已经过去一半了呢！\r\n真是时光飞逝呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02124a77ec29643eb25453544fe441186d9e29a3febbb37d957171b84781971a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09488dc5ca19c1a9a57e2c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来考虑下婚礼上怎么招待来宾吧！\r\n就用三明治作为手拿小吃怎么样？♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7aa03bdb7048c9608ef1fe85486498aedf65a8801b7a33c47d641e210bd94b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ee382f0ef80a106cd039e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱尔兰的婚礼会持续很长一段时间哦！\r\n大家一起彻夜饮酒跳舞……\r\n真的很有意思哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "466d263858ee9acfdc8167515bef14ff1a9cc8289d5f8d084beeef9bd1b093ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6ad200da87b69066bb7647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到First dance的时间了吧？\r\n一起分享这段无上美妙的时间吧～\r\n能请你牵上我的手吗，Darling？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0abb45aa0f701e7aa06a24b707d68ae3a8afb1c4ee9ed784e75d784dc517b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1794f8065f81b72fdf93337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚去赏了花，真的好美呢！\r\n樱花在身边飞舞，\r\n简直就像沐浴在婚礼的花雨中一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ddb3a3e2bc2c317b247e35106b120c04f6b8df9cc08f31248be2ef3b4dbbe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f050324d197063a2a408ca7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前段时间去小摊上玩了会『抠糖饼』，\r\n不过没想到店主对成品的审查那么严格，\r\n真是吓了我一跳呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d5dd59d42382ad94203686d1091edf3061fa7a8b36e18b423cf26c3a646d72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b092f2eae92bde7efc15f7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在看蜻蜓的时候，\r\n神宫教了我些很有意思的事情哦。\r\n……让我看看你的手指吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ffb7afb6fe734720bf4c45d39639f44b27210f3b071a8d807222b03780b5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72e04f32a0136ccb793c9a5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等冬天回爱尔兰的时候，\r\n干脆带些暖宝宝做伴手礼吧。\r\n女仆小姐们肯定会很开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b940996dc335403433cc48e0cf16d93f706cc0f2acbfd12dc1792383bfac2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdaeaf926b1ae7508e17459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcf0f841043bd89338ba593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79beec0caf3fadd135df3991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前呀，气槽同学跟我说\n『天天吃拉面，你真吃不厌啊』…\n因为有各种各样的味道，所以吃不厌哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a559beacbeb2f64b9381eb1e0148544796cbfc8e49a944fdaf8751fa77ae1f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d993243aa028c447ca7eb0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有次我想邀请神宫参加茶会，\n就说『咖啡因能提高工作效率』\n…结果她真的来了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e98d1654fbac3c428b1902c47baf361e1c1bf3485d978177974bcb9e4bee4cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a702d7ae7eae6586e03678b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小花的便当看起来就像是小小的宝石箱呢。\n也想让我家的主厨也看看呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4fdc9a779e23006fb7942021514eefc1193e7a99e2b3b7eb2f2ce5b26136599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3136cef70071123fd49dbdfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小川上给我推荐了『公主战士』！\n是部很有趣的电影呢～♪\n要是我的国家也上映就好啦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced3c672bf6e5ac14050870ef2f3d5ea55fc19461579a8a14a84f9476903852d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0642b5f0be238ea59933211",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然父亲已经允许了我的任性，\n那我也得拿出令他骄傲的成绩。\n这样才能昂首挺胸地回国嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddcab2cf296323e8245559e6da4e6237f528d214b49a366e061c987c86e59cd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd6eacbd92e091b2e0a6bf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又方便行动又不失华丽地衣服…！\n是谁设计的呢？\n还挺想向那人订制一件晚礼服的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b81d4e9326157dddea98a5b76b18552648ae78add6873836c0cb6e6c1e4aec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0388c6a02d3f07554f45e6da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家穿着一样的衣服的话，\n就有种麻利的感觉！\n这金色的纽扣也很棒哦～很像我家的仪仗兵呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21209c5b749f193c2cce6453bfff5020ea97c5551f9463466bb6ce4263a7442b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66dc7d24e790943d17b41a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服，\n是以我最喜欢的三叶草为主题设计的哦\n上面也有很多三叶草的装饰♪哼哼，要猜猜都在哪儿吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba1afac5b08906f1261bb54d7a4eada9883a19024d310e129118ed1fbf4b30f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dabdf5a53a30ce880f1c2417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵…制服也好，这件衣服也好，\n都是露出膝盖的设计，感觉很轻松呢！\n真是新鲜的感觉～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ce7c7241dda2e6c91c3d3fd68db722771f6bee0161290b4b1d23ada614eb5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5869d855e8f4b0898cb48610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上晨练的时候，\n看见伴着朝露的三叶草在闪闪发光啦～\n让我想起以前城堡里花园的事情了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d29926099d52fd4a8b48c486290cfea9bb0a8630f5470835db146ab5f28e97bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5a4ec75ca518f52fd04ed1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的训练也要努力了哦。\n能不能留下美好的回忆，\n取决于我的实力如何嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db828a3b0546f137d8be06e547fb1d1d03e452524277c3d69330fbe5068f0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65bffb4258636c5f07f21eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也得早点睡了呢。\n要是我熬夜太晚的话，\n护卫的各位轮流值班可是很辛苦的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b2441822624959b96840136241d112a9e055218bb49b2b768773fe35fb0e69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150ffb6ddba3024ac61ba9f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪这个国家的春天很漂亮，\n让人心情很好呢～♪\n一整天都能看见碧蓝的天空，像做梦一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77238e65c17bbd649296abcacf19f0265d747d443c0c62133991973d0aee6576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57932fd3ddee2dc24229a135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为日本的夏夜一整晚都很暗，\n所以能看见很漂亮的星星呢。\n是不是也能做个好梦呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "440f4d9aab7ead4029caba4a934d5d8bc44d7193bc56e12c0de73134c3083780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe95e1983186ad5be8bdf22e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在日本喜欢吃的东西…是松茸吧！\n闻起来很香，吃着也很美味呢～♪\n食堂会不会做呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9733b8c0bb6c9acddd978b18da3bec3637549207af18f968ae32fcdcbc531f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8d067ed7f92024345510a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被炉可真厉害呀～♪\n居然能把桌子和床合二为一…\n是足以授勋的好主意呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d849ec8ad33f6de35c7c7f7dd8b75eb3208d85dec1d0ea2efc9991a1fd165d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a75211b5fd9a5ff0ee1f0c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单身夜派对虽然很特别，但也容易让人觉得寂寞呢。\r\n要是我举办这个派对的话，大家会来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5690ede6f66e524c29a8e29e962d1324bf45dcc19e598deff85c7290be36334c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405873abf17eac1c6a1ba7f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我告诉我的姐姐，\r\n气槽同学也有一身非常漂亮的决胜服……\r\n哼哼，事态一下子就超出控制了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1a308fbca576f079fab734dabe5305167bd262da59f555a1d6ca2785c2cb2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e23c1e1f00e5c86d54fb986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在和多伯筹备下一次暗锅派对哦。\r\n训练员也要来吗？\r\n（暗锅派对：每个人随便带食材，把带来的食材全部著进锅里）",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e377668b60bf4d0906faf92abafeb7f4e42e66a5d9ce6c7623eb331fe6fe2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dd1387bb3485018ef5608f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前段时间，\r\n我悄悄去了光明爸爸开的那家游乐园哦。\r\n没想到平日里游乐园会有这么多人呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82deb10f5750cc4a7657031769e235a473961406bfeb38d629aa325978902f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a4b83664482fcc00bd39d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身决胜服的话，就不能吃拉面了呢……\r\n等等，要是用叉子的话说不定就可以了？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16c7d6446c0e5cd79a0135adad44b45dded2fbe7fec998b593149e95d145da4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91020"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
